From 7d3e5b1a0937e9dd9f9b19c22619276bd27d6280 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: inkling-turing <inkling-turing@local>
Date: Sun, 22 Nov 2026 16:47:47 +0100
Subject: [PATCH] inkling-turing: relative-bias node from positions
 (ggml_inkling2_relbias_pos): no CPU-built int32 distance matrix and no
 host-to-device copy of it, bit-exact

---
